# Geometry probe: boot, park bottom-right, open the C: window with a
# double-click on the drive icon.  `probe_dump` (menu rects + DISABLED bits)
# runs from `men_update`, `probe_icons` after the desktop is up and after every
# window repaint, so the serial log carries every click point this ticket set
# needs.  The C:-icon point (38,35) is the one the DESK03/DESK15 dumps printed;
# it is re-confirmed by this run's own desktop-up dump.
100 parkbr
300 move 600 460
1500 mark P_IDLE
1800 move 38 35
2100 down
2103 up
2108 down
2111 up
2600 move 600 460
3400 mark P_WIN
